        "আছেন": { "ro": "achhen", "en": "Are (polite)", "fr": "Êtes, allez (poli)", "pos": "verb", "note": "আছি, আছ, আছে and আছেন are one verb, \"to be (somewhere, in some state)\". The ending follows the person: আমি আছি, তুমি আছ, আপনি আছেন." },
